    "Modelled/inferred links are not validated direct attack events, even when included by GloBI with stage metadata.",
    "The food web describes one California pond and its literature/model-based reconstruction, not 11 independent freshwater field systems.",
    "Neither source provides the exact date/size of a predator-prey role switch or a frog-call cue-receiver action.",
    "The source categories observed/inferred/modelled are the original compilers' classifications, not validated event-level trial protocols.",
    "Species-pair reciprocity and actual stage-driven predator-prey switching are separate estimands."
